"""Write the pictures in docs/img/ from the real overlay.

The checkout's daemon and a copy of overlay/ run offscreen, in a temporary
home of their own (runtime, data, config, state and cache directories), seeded
with the synthetic fixtures beside this script. A test-only driver, Drive.qml,
is added to the copy and evaluates JavaScript sent over `quickshell ipc`: it
clicks and types as a user would and saves each window as it is drawn. No
window opens on the desktop and the user's daemon and socket are never touched.

Called with a directory, writes the pictures there and leaves docs/img alone.
"""

